# Materials of the gallery scene. The Kd of a textured material is the mean
# colour of its image, what the surface looks like without the map. The Phong
# spheres have no maps, only Kd / Ks / Ns (and d).

newmtl paving
Ka 0.59 0.56 0.44
Kd 0.59 0.56 0.44
Ks 0.6 0.6 0.6
Ns 24
map_Kd textures/paving_albedo.jpg
map_Ks textures/paving_specular.png
norm textures/paving_normal.png

